                                "sense_id": "2e755397-b8a3-3723-b56d-d1c2fd4966c4",
                                "text": "LEMON POSSET / WHY THIS RECIPE WORKS : The classic English dessert lemon posset transforms cream, sugar, and lemon into a lush pudding with clean citrus flavor. It is the easiest dessert you've never made.[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
